Cell["\<\
Every directed hopping matrix element is independent, although the bond \
geometry and Bloch phases still come from the lattice prepared by init.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"dcd4c139-1542-4c5a-ae54-504768978610"],

Cell["\<\
This is mainly useful for understanding how symmetry reduces the parameter \
space. Use symham to construct the physical symmetry-constrained model.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"c47432e9-acb0-4b08-9ae7-c5efd12d210c"]
}, Closed]],

